  ('Front-row seat at the JSNation keynote', 'The best seat in the house for the opening keynote. Close enough to read the speaker notes, far enough to avoid the confetti cannon.', 50, 10),
  ('Mystery box from the Supabase swag closet', 'Nobody knows what is in it. Possibly stickers. Possibly a hoodie. Possibly more stickers.', 25, 5),
  ('A rubber duck that has seen production', 'Retired after six years of on-call. Has heard every explanation of every outage. Still won''t tell you it was DNS, but it knows.', 20, 5),
  ('A first edition of JavaScript: The Good Parts', 'Mint condition, barely opened. It''s a quick read: you''ll finish it before the closing party, and still have time for the other parts.', 30, 5),
  ('Vintage jQuery plugin, mint condition', 'A carousel from 2011, never minified. Comes with its original README and a handwritten note that says works in IE6.', 15, 5),
  ('Lifetime supply of node_modules', 'Ships in forty boxes. Delivery takes about as long as a fresh install on conference Wi-Fi.', 10, 5);
